                                "sense_id": "40eb1385-1447-3ed3-a37b-dce9f9322415",
                                "text": "He succeeded in cutting the pad of his right palm quite badly on the blade of a paring knife before seizing two of the C-cells, but he felt this no more than he felt the burns he had sustained when he had been backsplashed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a1198403-1ed8-40bc-8fdc-ed2133d19cf7",
                                "sense_id": "40eb1385-1447-3ed3-a37b-dce9f9322415",
                                "text": "More importantly, the use of the delta tube prevents dangerous backsplashing of the agent that can occur when an impinging sparger is used improperly."
